   "description": "Docker containers on the TrueNAS boxes and the Frigate LXC (not the Talos cluster's pods). 'Up for' resets when a container restarts or is recreated. Network is 0 for containers sharing another's network (e.g. behind gluetun or a tailscale sidecar).",
